ge-included birding activity","wells":["stay"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["wildlife"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"destination","safari":"destination","wildlife":"primary"},"commission_lane":["hotel"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Jabiru stork nesting & wading-bird flocks","si_tag":"wildlife","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.pantanaljaguarsafaris.com/best-time-to-visit","hook":"Jabiru nesting Jul–early Nov; massive wading-bird gatherings late Jul–mid-Aug. A world-class birding jewel","si":"wildlife","blurb":"Jabiru nesting Jul–early Nov; massive wading-bird gatherings late Jul–mid-Aug. A world-class birding jewel","commission":"birding-specialist DMC / lodge program","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["wildlife"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"destination","safari":"destination","wildlife":"primary"},"commission_lane":["DMC","hotel"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Piranha fishing","si_tag":"wildlife","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.brazilnaturetours.com/vacation-packages/pantanal","timing":"Dry season Jul-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"wildlife","when":"Dry season Jul-Oct","commission":"lodge-included excursion","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["wildlife"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"destination","safari":"destination","wildlife":"primary"},"commission_lane":["hotel"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"650+ bird / 120+ mammal biodiversity immersion","si_tag":"wildlife","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.wildlifeworldwide.com/locations/the-pantanal","timing":"Dry season Jul-Oct","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"For the dedicated naturalist, the sheer species list is the jewel — multi-day birding-and-mammal itineraries across both Pantanals","si":"wildlife","blurb":"For the dedicated naturalist, the sheer species list is the jewel — multi-day birding-and-mammal itineraries across both Pantanals","when":"Dry season Jul-Oct","commission":"birding-specialist DMC multi-day land package","wells":["activities"],"wells_basis":"pass 2 — text","si_all":["wildlife"],"shelf_fit":{"expedition":"destination","safari":"destination","wildlife":"primary"},"commission_lane":["DMC","package"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"When is the best time to see jaguars in the Pantanal?","a":"The dry season, roughly June–October, is the whole game: falling water concentrates wildlife on the riverbanks, and late July through early October is the optimum, with August–September the strongest months — Porto Jofre boat-safari sightings run 80–90% over a multi-day trip.","source":"pantanaljaguarsafaris.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safari"},{"q":"Can you self-drive the Transpantaneira?","a":"Yes, but it''s higher-risk and guided is strongly preferred: a 4x4 is recommended for the 122 wooden bridges, you must fill fuel in Poconé because there are no stations after it, and with no services or cell coverage you must plan the medevac gap yourself.","source":"wildjunket.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"Is the Pantanal good for birding?","a":"Exceptionally, and year-round: the wetland lists 650+ bird species, with jabiru storks nesting July–early November and the biggest wading-bird flocks gathering late July to mid-August — a birding counterweight that props up the shoulders of the jaguar season.","source":"wildlifeworldwide.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"wildlife"},{"q":"Can the Pantanal work for a honeymoon?","a":"Yes, as a wild-honeymoon rather than a beach one: SouthWild''s Jaguar Suites are 30 m² glass-walled floating rooms with AC and WiFi anchored in the jaguar zone, boats leaving from the deck — private guiding and sundowners over the wetland for the couple who wants adventure over sand.","source":"southwild.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for in the Pantanal?","a":"Wildfire in the late dry season: 2020 fires burned about 31% of the wetland and affected roughly 45% of the jaguar population, and 2024 brought the worst fire count since records began in 1999 — well over a million hectares. Monitor fire and air-quality conditions for late-dry departures and keep flexible-rebooking language in the flow.","source":"news.mongabay.com, 2026-07-07; fireandsafetyjournalamericas.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Do I need vaccinations or malaria pills for the Pantanal?","a":"It''s zone-dependent: CDC notes malaria risk in parts of the state of Mato Grosso (Northern Pantanal) but not in Cuiabá city or Mato Grosso do Sul (Southern Pantanal), so route the health note by access door; yellow-fever vaccination is recommended for Mato Grosso, and dengue/chikungunya precautions apply regardless of malaria zone.","source":"jmbeetravelhealth.com, 2026-07-07; cdc.gov, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"The Pantanal, Brazil — World''s Best Jaguar Safari & Wildlife Wetland | TravelWell.World","meta_description":"Plan a Pantanal jaguar safari: the world''s best wild-jaguar viewing at Porto Jofre, dry-season timing, Northern vs Southern access, eco-lodges by tier, and safety. Freely bookable.","search_language":"pt-BR","local_keywords":["Pantanal onças","safári de onça-pintada","Porto Jofre","Transpantaneira","onça-pintada Pantanal","melhor época para ver onças no Pantanal","pousadas Pantanal","arara-azul Pantanal","Pantanal norte e sul"],"hreflang":["en","pt-BR"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","primary_keyword":"The Pantanal","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-08-20","last_verified_basis":"safety.fcdo.read","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/brazil","read":"2026-08-20T14:54:23Z","source_updated":"2026-05-11T12:32:48+01:00"}]},"content_freshness":"2026-07-07","long_tail":["best time to see jaguars in the Pantanal","Pantanal jaguar safari Porto Jofre","Transpantaneira road self-drive","Northern vs Southern Pantanal","Pantanal eco lodges by tier","hyacinth macaw Pantanal birding","jaguar flotel Porto Jofre","Caiman Ecological Refuge Onçafari"]},"booking":{"advisory_updated":"2026-08-20","advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"safari","status":"live"},{"si":"wildlife","status":"live"},{"si":"expedition","status":"live"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Caiman Ecological Refuge","location":"Southern Pantanal (~236 km from Campo Grande)","note":"53,000 ha, 3 lodges (Casa Caiman/Cordilheira/Baiazinha); Onçafari jaguar-habituation project","earning":"preferred-agent / consortium net + amenity","mor":"agent on land package","tier":"ultra"},{"name":"Fazenda Barranco Alto","location":"Southern Pantanal","note":"11,000 ha owner-run exclusive-use wildlife lodge","earning":"consortium/specialist net","mor":"agent on package","tier":"ultra"},{"name":"Araras Eco Lodge","location":"Northern Pantanal (Transpantaneira lane)","note":"~3,000+ ha private land, hyacinth-macaw territory, UNESCO setting","earning":"operator net / agent commission","mor":"agent on land package","tier":"premier"},{"name":"SouthWild Jaguar Flotel & Jaguar Suites","location":"Porto Jofre (floating, Piquirí River)","note":"floating hotels in jaguar zone; AC/WiFi/30 m2 rooms; boats from the deck","earning":"SouthWild net / tour-operator terms","mor":"agent on package","tier":"ultra"},{"name":"Mobile tented jaguar camp","location":"Porto Jofre core","note":"expedition-grade seasonal tented camping in jaguar zone","earning":"specialist expedition-operator net","mor":"agent","tier":"ultra"}],"source_verified":null,"hero":{"query":"The Pantanal, Brazil, Brazil"},"geo":{"lat":-16.35,"lng":-56.6667},"orbit":[{"id":"bonito-brazil","jewels":9,"si":["wildlife"]},{"id":"foz-do-iguacu-brazil","jewels":9,"si":["expedition","culture","romance"]},{"id":"manaus-amazon-brazil","jewels":11,"si":["adventure","river","romance","wildlife"]}],"orbit_country":["fernando-de-noronha-brazil","jericoacoara-brazil","ouro-preto-tiradentes-brazil","rio-de-janeiro-brazil","sao-paulo-brazil","salvador-brazil"]}'::jsonb, 80)
