Caribbean-facing beaches are affected, so plan cenote and reef days as hedges; drink bottled water, use repellent for dengue (no malaria in the tourist zone), and note hurricane season runs June–November, September riskiest.","source":"howisthesargassum.com","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Is Puerto Morelos good for diving and the Juan Escutia wreck?","a":"Yes — it is an underrated day-boat dive base. The Puerto Morelos Reef National Park sits under 500 m offshore, one of the Caribbean''s best-preserved reefs, and the sunken Juan Escutia is now an artificial reef and fish refuge steps away. Visibility is best in the dry Oct–March window; book in town, where it is cheaper and supports local operators.","source":"voyage-mexico.com","si_tag":"diveglobal"},{"q":"Can I go deep-sea fishing from Puerto Morelos?","a":"Yes — it is a working fishing port, so charters are authentic and close at hand. Half- and full-day trips target dorado (mahi-mahi), wahoo, tuna and barracuda, with gear and guide included; the species mix is seasonal, so confirm with the operator. It pairs naturally with the fresh-off-the-boat ceviche at the beachfront cantinas.","source":"voyage-mexico.com","si_tag":"ocean"},{"q":"What is the Route of the Cenotes?","a":"A ~17 km jungle road of cenotes running inland from town — Puerto Morelos is its northern gateway. It strings together open, semi-open and cave cenotes for swimming, cavern diving and ziplining, at roughly 150–250 MXN entry each. Because they are shaded jungle sites, cenotes are weather-resilient — a strong rainy-day and green-season option.","source":"snorkelingadventure.com","si_tag":"globaladv"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Puerto Morelos, Mexico: Reef, Cenotes & Fishing Village","meta_description":"A quiet Riviera Maya port with a national-park reef 500 m offshore, the Juan Escutia wreck, and the Route of the Cenotes. Cheaper than Cancún — when and how to book.","slug":"puerto-morelos-mexico","primary_keyword":"Puerto Morelos reef diving","long_tail":["Puerto Morelos Reef National Park","Juan Escutia wreck dive","Route of the Cenotes Puerto Morelos","Puerto Morelos fishing village","Puerto Morelos vs Cancun value"],"search_language":"es-MX (restated, not machine-translated)","local_keywords":["arrecife Puerto Morelos","Parque Nacional Arrecife de Puerto Morelos","buceo pecio Juan Escutia","Ruta de los Cenotes","pueblo pesquero Puerto Morelos","villas frente al mar Puerto Morelos","qué hacer en Puerto Morelos"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-04","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-04","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/mexico","read":"2026-08-20T14:49:02Z","source_updated":"2026-07-16T16:08:09+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"codes":[],"note":"MXN currency, USD widely accepted","advisory_updated":"2026-08-20","advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-07-31","hits":7,"misses":15,"disregarded":3,"note":"Canonical 25-SI list; sports limited to participant; spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"diveglobal","name":"diveglobal","status":"future"},{"si":"ocean","name":"ocean","status":"future"},{"si":"globaladv","name":"adventure","status":"future"},{"si":"culinary","name":"culinary","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Zoëtry / Royalton Reserve Paraíso de la Bonita, a Luxury Collection Resort, Riviera Maya","why_ultra":"IN Puerto Morelos (Hwy Km 328); 90-100 ocean-front suites w/ plunge pools, 14 acres, thalasso spa, one of only 3 Luxury Collection all-inclusives worldwide, AAA Five Diamond 15 yrs (Zoëtry heritage); rebranded to Royalton Reserve adults-only, operating 2026 - verify current brand","earning":"on application / via host-Virtuoso (Marriott Luxury Collection + Royalton/Blue Diamond); verify %","virtuoso_value_add":"verify Marriott STARS/Luxury Collection amenities - not documented","mor":"commission-on-net; no net-rate resale markup","source":"https://www.tripadvisor.com/Hotel_Review-g240327-d28213141-Reviews-Royalton_Reserve_Paraiso_de_la_Bonita_a_Luxury_Collection_Resort_Riviera_Maya_Adult_A.html"},{"name":"Mayakoba enclave (Rosewood / Banyan Tree / Fairmont / Andaz) - ADJACENT, verify municipality","why_ultra":"620-acre gated ultra enclave, 4 flagship resorts; STRAIGHT GEOGRAPHY: administratively in Solidaridad (Km 298, Playa del Carmen area), NOT Puerto Morelos - do not label as in Puerto Morelos; nearest true-ultra cluster + standard corridor pull-out","earning":"on application / via host-Virtuoso (Rosewood Elite / Fairmont / Hyatt Prive / Banyan Tree); verify %","virtuoso_value_add":"Rosewood Mayakoba is Virtuoso-preferred - verify current amenity package","mor":"commission-on-net; no resale markup","source":"https://www.jetsetchristina.com/where-to-stay-in-mayakoba-mexico-rosewood-vs-fairmont-vs-andaz-vs-banyan-tree/"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-04","hero":{"query":"Puerto Morelos, Mexico"},"geo":{"lat":20.8478,"lng":-86.8758},"orbit":[{"id":"akumal-mexico","jewels":5,"si":["diveglobal","ocean","culture"]},{"id":"bacalar-mexico","jewels":6,"si":["tropical","wellness","adventure"]},{"id":"cancun-mexico","jewels":5,"si":["tropical","adventure","diveglobal","ocean"]},{"id":"coba-mexico","jewels":5,"si":["culture","expedition","family"]},{"id":"cozumel-mexico","jewels":5,"si":["diveglobal","liveaboard","ocean"]},{"id":"holbox-mexico","jewels":4,"si":["expedition","romance","ocean","wildlife"]},{"id":"isla-contoy-mexico","jewels":3,"si":["expedition","ocean","wildlife"]},{"id":"isla-mujeres-mexico","jewels"